fn main(){ for s in ["\"\\ud800\\uffff\"","\"\\ud800\\ue000\"","\"\\udbff\\uffff\"","\"\\ud800\"","\"\\ud800\\u0041\"","\"\\ud800\\uZZZZ\"","\"\\ud800x\""] { let mut b=s.as_bytes().to_vec(); println!("{} -> {:?}   serde_json {:?}",s,simd_json::to_owned_value(&mut b).map(|v|{use simd_json::prelude::*; v.as_str().unwrap().chars().map(|c|format!("U+{:04X}",c as u32)).collect::<Vec<_>>()}).map_err(|e|format!("{:?}",e.error())),serde_json::from_str::<String>(s).map_err(|e|e.to_string()).map(|_|"ok")); } }
